    {"problem": "The heat pump quote was based on square footage alone", "solution": "Square footage says nothing about six adults cooking, showering and running laptops in one house. We do a room-by-room heat-loss and heat-gain calculation that counts people, appliances, the finished basement and the afternoon sun on the back windows, then pick the tonnage from that."},
